                    <div class="key-takeaways">
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>async enables await; await pauses execution.</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Return Task, not void (except event handlers).</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Start tasks first, await later for concurrency.</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Use ConfigureAwait(false) in library code.</span></div>
                    </div>
